Note for Janam	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Note for Janam","wikiPath":"/Note_for_Janam","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"East Freeport","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Harkin Duskfoot","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Used Merchants Gloves","item":"Used Merchants Gloves","wikiPath":"/Used_Merchants_Gloves"},{"text":"Faction","item":"Faction","wikiPath":"/Faction"},{"text":"Experience"}],"card":{"title":"Note for Janam","lines":["Minimum Level: 1+","Classes: All","Related Zones: West Freeport","Related NPCs: Janam"]},"links":["Freeport","Harkin Duskfoot","West Freeport","Janam","Used Merchants Gloves","Faction","East Freeport#East Freeport Tunnels","Dismal Rage","Beur Tenlah","Dwarven Ale","Note to Janam","Note to Harkin","Coalition of Tradefolk Underground","Coalition of Tradefolk","Carson McCabe","Corrupt Qeynos Guards","The Freeport Militia","Note for Rebby"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Harkin Duskfoot","text":"HA! Greetings there, ______! How are ya this fine day? Me? I'm doing all right. Guard duty down here always reminds me of home."},{"npc":"Beur Tenlah","text":"Heh, I got something that reminds you of home.. My armpit! Bwa haha!!!"},{"npc":"Beur Tenlah","text":"Heya, ______! I've been on watch duty all night. Kinda makes a man thirsty, ya know? Why don't you be a good little scamp and run up to the bar and get me a [dwarven ale]? That sure would hit the spot right about now."},{"npc":"Beur Tenlah","text":"Well, well, well.. It's about time. Whatta ya got, boots fulla stones? Or maybe yer just part turtle? Bah, anyways, thanks for the ale. Maybe I'll buy you one sometime, eh? Bwahaha!"},{"npc":"Harkin Duskfoot","text":"Bah! Don't listen to this fool. Listen, I've something a little more important for you to do than buy ales. I need you to take a [message] to my friend Janam over in West Freeport."},{"npc":"Harkin Duskfoot","text":"Ok, ______, I need you to take this message to Janam in West Freeport. He is usually hanging out in front of the Theater of the Tranquil with that good-for-nothing Rebby. Anyway, give this note to Janam and bring his reply back to me."},{"npc":"Janam Rekish","text":"Ah, hello there, friend! Me an' Rebby here, we're a just couple o' regular merchants. Though we've got nothin' to sell right now, we'd gladly take any donations. Them's the breaks, I suppose."},{"npc":"Janam Rekish scribbles out a note and","text":"Please make sure that Harkin gets this right away. If you lose it, it could mean both of our heads."},{"npc":"Harkin Duskfoot","text":"Ah, good work, ______. And quick too, I'll makes sure that Elisi hears of your loyal work. Here... take this for your efforts.. it's not much, but it's all I have on me right now."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T08:58:19.116Z","outOfEra":false}
