The Bridge	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Bridge","wikiPath":"/The_Bridge","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Erudin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Weligon Steelherder","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Human Decapitated Head","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Human_Decapitated_Head"},{"name":"Gnome Decapitated Head","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Gnome_Decapitated_Head"},{"name":"Dwarf Decapitated Head","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Dwarf_Decapitated_Head"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Deep Six Cutlass","item":"Deep Six Cutlass","wikiPath":"/Deep_Six_Cutlass"}],"card":{"title":"The Bridge","lines":["Minimum Level: 30+","Classes: Paladin","Related Zones: High Keep, Kaladim, Qeynos, Steamfont Mountains","Related NPCs: Hansl Bigroon, Jogl Doobraugh, Purchin Oddsbot, Trantor Everhot","Required Faction: Amiable"]},"links":["Erudin","Weligon Steelherder","Paladin","High Keep","Kaladim","Qeynos","Steamfont Mountains","Hansl Bigroon","Jogl Doobraugh","Purchin Oddsbot","Trantor Everhot","Deep Six Cutlass","Enduring Breath","Arcane Scientists","Eldritch Collective","Storm Guard","Prexus","Deepwater Knights","Sealed List","Human Decapitated Head","Charlotte","Gnome Decapitated Head","Dwarf Decapitated Head","High Council of Erudin","Heretics","Kerra Isle","Sentry Xyrin Quest"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Weligon Steelherder","text":"Hail, _______! This is the Deepwater Temple. Here you shall find the wisdom and courage of Prexus, the Ocean Lord. I am glad to see you have an interest. Forgive me if I cut our conversation short, but I have many [Deepwater tasks] to complete."},{"npc":"Weligon Steelherder","text":"We here at the Deepwater Temple must tend to the [Peacekeeper battlestaff] and the [Deepwater harpoon] as well as other duties such as [ocean protection]. There is always something we must do."},{"npc":"Weligon Steelherder","text":"We do not award the Deepwater harpoon to just any paladin. Nobility is all well and good, but you must still prove yourself. We have heard rumors of a very distressing matter. Perhaps it is your calling. Are you ready to [prove allegiance to Erudin] and earn the Deepwater harpoon?"},{"npc":"Weligon Steelherder","text":"Yes, you are ready. We have heard rumors of a great bridge which will connect Antonica with Odus! This must not happen! We must shield ourselves from the savage and evil ways of the other races. They say that a list exists. A list of three grand architects who wish to see this bridge erected. You will venture to Qeynos and find the list, then exterminate these three men. Return the list along with their heads and the Deepwater Harpoon is yours. Go!"},{"npc":"Hansl Bigroon","text":"Greetings, ______! Are you a [citizen of Qeynos] or are you a [traveler of sorts]?"},{"npc":"Hansl Bigroon","text":"Ah, yes! Traveling can be truly dangerous. Have you ever been to Erudin or do you not care for that place?"},{"npc":"Hansl Bigroon","text":"The trip to Erudin takes far too long. I have been designing a [titanic bridge] which will shorten the trip. Well, I cannot take full credit, most of the plans are being designed by [three great engineers]."},{"npc":"Hansl Bigroon","text":"My grand plan has always been to erect a bridge which would span the distance between Qeynos and Odus. It would bypass the city of Erudin. Antonius Bayle would take full control of the bridge and its adjacent territories. This has had some opposition in Erudin, but for the most part, they just believe it is impossible to build such a bridge."},{"npc":"Hansl Bigroon","text":"They are some of the finest engineers in all of Norrath. Young, they may be, but as smart as the wisest architects I have ever met. That reminds me... I must have a [list of the engineers] somewhere... Where is it?"},{"npc":"Hansl Bigroon","text":"Do not concern yourself with the list. It is of no concern to you. I do not even have it. It is tucked away safely at home."},{"npc":"Hansl Bigroon picks up a discarded item from the ground and","text":"Don't people have enough respect for our grand city to not throw things onto the streets?!"},{"npc":"Jogl Doobraugh","text":"Hellooo!! My name is Jogl, master engineer with the Eldritch Collective. And this here is Charlotte. Pay no mind to her, she won't bite unless you attack me."},{"npc":"Trantor Everhot","text":"Yes, yes!! I am a very busy man. I've got blueprints to work on, [dwarven wire] to perfect and formulae to calculate. In between those tasks, I have to find time to head down to Irontoe's and down a few Tumpy Tonics."},{"npc":"Weligon Steelherder","text":"It is done! I pray to Prexus that the knowledge of the bridge's design has departed from this world with the passing of these intelligent men. A pity they had to die. As for you, the other states may not tolerate your presence any longer, but you have proven that allegiance to Erudin is paramount among all Erudites. I am afraid the [harpoon is no more]! I bestow upon you Deep Six, my personal cutlass! May you wield it in the name of Erudin."},{"npc":"Tiam Khonsir","text":"Well, Weligon Steelherder, that is unfortunate. Quite a pity, indeed."},{"npc":"Weligon Steelherder","text":"The Deepwater harpoon's distribution has been restricted by order of the High Council. The last one awarded was to an outsider, the brave and noble paladin, Sentry Xyrin. She hailed from the Temple of Marr."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T10:32:03.081Z","outOfEra":false}
Cazic Thule Initiate	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Cazic Thule Symbol Quests","wikiPath":"/Cazic_Thule_Symbol_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Paineel","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Sern Adolia, Atdehim Sqonci","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Initiate Symbol of Cazic Thule","item":"Initiate Symbol of Cazic Thule","wikiPath":"/Initiate_Symbol_of_Cazic_Thule"},{"text":"Disciple Symbol of Cazic Thule","item":"Disciple Symbol of Cazic Thule","wikiPath":"/Disciple_Symbol_of_Cazic_Thule"}],"card":{"title":"Cazic Thule Symbol Quests","lines":["Minimum Level: 1+","Classes: Cleric, Shaman","Related Zones: Everfrost Peaks, Kerra Island, Toxxulia Forest","Required Faction: Indifferent or better"]},"links":["Paineel","Sern Adolia","Atdehim Sqonci","Cleric","Shaman","Cazic-Thule","Everfrost Peaks","Kerra Island","Toxxulia Forest","Initiate Symbol of Cazic Thule","Spook the Dead","Disciple Symbol of Cazic Thule","Panic Animal","An undead rat","An infected rat","Infected Rat Livers","Heretics","Deepwater Knights","Gate Callers","Craftkeepers","Crimson Hands","The Summoning of Fright","Kerran Doll","A kerran awrat","Lomarc","Qeynos","Giant Snake Fang","Ichor","A giant wooly spider"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Sern Adolia","text":"I hope you have a good reason for disturbing my contemplations. Perhaps you [seek the knowledge] of those who meditate within this Temple of Fear?"},{"npc":"Sern Adolia","text":"It is the secrets of fear that you seek, but you must first prove your devotion to our temple. There are pack rats within the city that have a habit of getting into things. Some of these rats have ingested a concoction developed by the necromancers of this great city. The rats have since died, and due to the concoction their undead corpses now roam the fields. Bring me four of the livers from these undead rats so that we may examine them."},{"npc":"Sern Adolia","text":"I need no fewer than four infected rat livers!! Now, go get me what I require!!"},{"npc":"Sern Adolia","text":"Well done, go now and continue your contemplations of fear. Keep up with your [duties] and you will soon be reaping the rewards granted by our Lord Cazic Thule!!"},{"npc":"Atdehim Sqonci","text":"Ah. greetings. I hope you are a student of the way of fear. Within this temple there are many who can teach you to harness your gifts. I am an instructor in the [rituals of fear]."},{"npc":"Atdehim Sqonci","text":"So you wish to learn, eh? I am working on a ritual to strike fear into the hearts of the other inhabitants of Odus. The reagents I require for this ritual are the doll of a Kerran priestess, the ichor of a giant wooly spider, your initiate symbol of Cazic-Thule, and a giant snake fang with which to carve my glyphs. Fetch me these components and we shall infect this land with fear, and I shall reward you with the station of disciple of this temple."},{"npc":"Atdehim Sqonci","text":"I need all four of the items I asked for! Incompetence is not tolerated in this tabernacle!"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22T23:58:40.194Z","outOfEra":true}
