Ridossan's Spirit	27	{"kind":"quest","title":"Ridossan's Spirit","wikiPath":"/Ridossan's_Spirit","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Stonebrunt Mountains","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"a spirit","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Soulfiend Lance","item":"Soulfiend Lance","wikiPath":"/Soulfiend_Lance"}],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Kejek Village"}," got worse (-25)"],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Peace Keepers"}," got worse (-2)."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Give Ghost of Ridossan the Idol of Fear."],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Heretics"}," got better (10)."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Deepwater Knights"}," got worse (-10)."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Gate Callers"}," got worse (-10)."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Craftkeepers"}," got worse (-10)."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Crimson Hands"}," got worse (-10)."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Kerra Isle"}," got worse (-1)."],"steps":[]}]}],"card":{"title":"Ridossan's Spirit","lines":["Minimum Level: 25","Classes: Shadow Knight","Related Zones: Cazic Thule","Related NPCs: Disciple Okarote, Ridossan the Unliving, a lizard ritualist","Required Faction: Amiable or better"]},"links":["Stonebrunt Mountains","A spirit","Shadow Knight","Cazic Thule","Disciple Okarote","Ridossan the Unliving","A lizard ritualist","Soulfiend Lance","Leech","Heretics","Grimy Lance","Stonebrunt","Idol of Fear","Kejek Village","Peace Keepers","Ghost of Ridossan","Deepwater Knights","Gate Callers","Craftkeepers","Crimson Hands","Kerra Isle"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"a spirit","text":"Yes, the lance!' and begins to glow as it draws power from the lance, which now floats in mid air next to the spirit. The form of the spirit expands and takes on a humanoid shape. The air itself then seems to condense about the spirit as bits of matter appear within the glowing form. The bits soon take the shape of bones and ropes of muscle. Within minutes, an emaciated Erudite male stands before you. Despite his frail appearance, he stands upright and strong, a fierce red light burning in his eyes."},{"npc":"Ridossan the Unliving gazes upon his lance and begins to laugh maniacally. He","text":"AH HAH! I am corporeal once more! I cannot hold this form for long, but it will be long enough for me to rip open that flea brothel and... well, I won't spoil it for you, heheheheh. Come! Assist me in the attack on the Kejekan village! The one that wears the iron beads must die at my hands and NO OTHER! Just make sure I get to him and you will be rewarded."},{"npc":"Ridossan the Unliving","text":"Kejekan! You smell it? That's the smell of death!"},{"npc":"Ridossan the Unliving","text":"He's escaped. I've failed.' Ridossan suddenly collapses into a pile of dust and is gone."},{"npc":"Disciple Okarote","text":"You may have slain me, but your conscience will slay you in the end, and it will be a hundred times more painful."},{"npc":"Ghost of Ridossan","text":"I will soon move on from this world to meet my ultimate fate. But before I go, I must reward the stranger that assisted me. Hand me the idol I gave you and you will be rewarded."},{"npc":"Ghost of Ridossan takes the idol into his spectral hand and shoves the lance into your arms. After letting go of the lance, the ghost immediately begins to fade away. Before it is gone completely, it looks into your eyes and","text":"Suffer."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T04:29:37.056Z","outOfEra":false}
